WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Tshika mibhedhi ya mune laha yi nga kona. Rhurhisa ndyangu wun'wana ni wun'wana eka mubhedhi lowuntshwa lembe ni lembe.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Hi lembe ro sungula, khavichi yi mila emubedhini wo sungula.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Hi lembe ra vumbirhi, rhurhisa khavichi. Tikherotsi ti teka ndhawu ya yona.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Hi lembe ra vunharhu, tinyawa ti teka mubhedhi wo sungula. Mindyangu leyin'wana na yona yi rhurha.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Hi lembe ra vumune, tinyala ti teka mubhedhi wo sungula.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Mubhedhi wo sungula wu ve ni mindyangu ya mune leyi hambaneke hi malembe ya mune. Kutani ku nga sunguriwa nakambe.
